Package: swarm-terminal
Version: 0.1.14
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: SWARM local build <noreply@localhost>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-vte-2.91 (>= 0.68)
Description: Native terminal workspace for Codex CLI agents
 SWARM opens an interactive shell in a GTK terminal workspace and manages
 Codex CLI sessions in tabs. Broadcast messages to active agent sessions
 in the current window.
 The Codex CLI is installed separately.
